<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82748" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτευρον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roosting-perch</i> for fowls,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				839
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				13.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				197
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>pole, spar,
				plank</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				884
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>springboard</i>, used by tumblers and acrobats, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				6.444
			</span></i>, Epic.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				7p.5
			</span></i>; Lat.<i>petaurus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Juv.
				14.265
			</span></i>, etc., but abl.<i>peteuro</i> (v.l.
			<i>petauro</i>), Lucil.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1298
			</span></i> Marx. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>platform, stage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.4.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>springe, trap</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πέτευρον ᾅδου συναντᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					9.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>public notice-board,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				7.235.42
			</span></i> (Oropus, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
				τῷ λόγῳ</span> (for publication of accounts) ib.<i><span class="en">
				11(2).145.44
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
